906
00:51:29.711 --> 00:51:30.796
Nandoon ang malaking punso.

907
00:51:30.879 --> 00:51:32.798
-Sige, aakyat tayo ng burol.
-Oo.

908
00:51:32.881 --> 00:51:34.174
